This package contains the alpha user release of Anteater Chess.
It is an early preview of the program and may still contain incomplete
features or other limitations typical of an alpha version.

Package contents:
- bin/chess
  Executable chess program
- bin/logs/
  Runtime log directory
- doc/Chess_UserManual.pdf
  User documentation

Quick start:
1. Extract the package.
2. Enter the extracted package directory:
   cd Chess_Alpha
3. Run the program with:
   ./bin/chess

Runtime logs are written to:
- bin/logs/

For gameplay rules, usage instructions, and the currently supported features,
please refer to doc/Chess_UserManual.pdf.
